# GetTickCount stored for a later difference (14), used in a subtraction /
# comparison (16), assigned through the call form (21) and as an inline-var
# initialiser (22) fires; GetTickCount64 (15) must not.
# SLZ-RULE1 2026-11-19: GetTickCount used only as a NAME / SEED -- a Format
# argument (18), concatenated into a temp-dir name through a cast (19) -- is
# not elapsed-time math and must not fire (CLI.pas:22851/27255/27322 shape).
gettickcount-wraparound 14
gettickcount-wraparound 16
gettickcount-wraparound 21
gettickcount-wraparound 22
!gettickcount-wraparound 15
!gettickcount-wraparound 18
!gettickcount-wraparound 19